_4324574277696688193_n.png?_nc_cat=107&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=rrRpwwwpAIoQ7kNvwGT5UMr&_nc_oc=Adr7S25RleBFrCroJ2MMvQMgYinuJbRERAF_HCeS6ZDUqEwvqNGByd3KIJjz4c0Xt60&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-ord5-2.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQQSMVX15XAV66hAI3AVtdrRJoeSJoJPfK2jgYQ5yV4-Xg&oe=6AEF534C"}], "video_trailer": null, "video_trailer_thumbnail": {"file_name": "CoverImageSafeAreaTemplate not t miniLandscape AjCdCbungled2.png", "id": "708936720888215", "uri": "https://scontent-ord5-2.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/38974760_708936724221548_3711930545680267382_n.png?_nc_cat=100&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=UCmuxYXCQU4Q7kNvwE8iRDJ&_nc_oc=AdqmOk5O3Yk4do9qygR9BCNDfFnJaWtDtjHcWbmHy1Sebyi7YBKwhXPIhxzTUdRTftE&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-ord5-2.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQRwEFbdvRK45UCMpth1dtmM025eF2ylHQ7dE9ADD3rc1w&oe=6AEF4B81"}, "display_name": "Jungle Passthrough", "keywords": [], "long_description": "Create a detailed jungle in your home using passthrough\no 70+ Plants and jungle objects\no 60+ Animals\no 5+ bonus pieces of furniture\n\nPlants, animals, and furniture can be moved, deleted, or respawned (random spawner for each type)\n\nVarious levels include:\n- Randomly spawned jungles\n- Ability to spawn and add plants, animals, and furniture to edit each level\n- Premade room sizes (10x10 and 30x30 feet)\n\nAnimals: elephants, tigers, leopards, lions, croc, turtle, dinos, birds, farm animals, and many more", "short_description": "Create a detailed jungle in your home using passthrough\no 70+ Plants & jungle objects\no 60+ Animals\no 5+ bonus pieces of furniture\n\nPlants, animals, and furniture can be moved, deleted, or respawned (random spawners for each)\n\nVarious levels include:\n- Randomly spawned jungles\n- Ability to spawn and add plants, animals, and furniture to edit each level\n- Premade room sizes (10x10 and 30x30 feet)\n\nAnimals: elephants, tigers, leopards, lions, croc, turtle, dinos, birds, farm animals, and many more"}]}, "developer_name": null, "devel